# RentLoop Frontend

## Stack (do not change)

React + JavaScript + Vite + Tailwind + Framer Motion + Lucide. No TypeScript. No framework swap. Add deps only with clear need.

## Structure

`src/components/{layout,home,ui}`, `src/pages`, `src/data`, `src/assets`. Keep App thin. Split large components; avoid tiny one-off fragments.

## Design

Communicate LOCAL + TRUST + SHARING + CONVENIENCE. Polished startup quality, own visual identity—not generic college/dashboard UI.

Emphasize nearby items, ₹/day, duration, availability, owner, distance, ratings—not normal e-commerce.

Hero: brand-first, clear value in seconds. Use purposeful Framer Motion only (entrance, hover, menu)—not constant motion.

## Responsive & a11y

Desktop → mobile layouts (not just shrink). Semantic HTML, labels, alt text, focus states, image fallbacks.

## Images & data

Rental-relevant images with consistent ratios. Realistic demo data (e.g. Sony Alpha, ₹800/day, Chandigarh)—no lorem ipsum.
